// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Twilight Grasp 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4164717180" "Twilight Grasp"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1331656250" "Ranged, Foe -To Hit, -DMG, -Regen, Team Heal"
// Power Help Text :
"P3867344021" "You channel Negative Energy from the Netherworld through yourself to a targeted foe. Twilight Grasp drains the power from that target and slowly transfers it to you and all nearby allies. The targeted foe's chance to hit, damage and regeneration rate are reduced, while you and your nearby allies are healed. Recharge: Moderate"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1216526605" "You hit {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} reducing their damage and chance to hit and healing you and your allies!"
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3862772857" "{PlayerSource} hits you with their {PowerName} reducing your damage output and chance to hit!"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1306857758" "-To Hit, -DMG, -Regen"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P810523703" "The Twilight Grasp has reduced your chance to hit, Damage potential, and regeneration rate."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Tar Patch 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1281699562" "Tar Patch"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2412290026" "Ranged (Location AoE), Target -Speed, -Res, -Fly"
// Power Help Text :
"P2097823509" "Drops a large patch of viscous Negative Energy which dramatically slows down enemies that run through it and reduces their damage resistance. Affected targets stuck in the Tar Patch cannot jump or fly. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2018496806" "-SPD, -Res, -Fly"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2237864073" "Your Running speed and damage resistance is reduced by the Tar Patch.  You cannot jump or fly away while in the Tar Patch"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Darkest Night 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1936194933" "Darkest Night"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P553898035" "Toggle: Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -DMG, -To Hit"
// Power Help Text :
"P208736741" "While active, you channel Negative Energy onto a targeted foe. While Darkest Night is active the target, and all foes nearby, will have their chance to hit and Damage potential reduced as long as you keep the power active. Recharge: Moderate"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2595569261" "Your {PowerName} reduced the chance to hit and damage of {PlayerDest}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1811048855" "{PlayerSource} reduces your damage with their {PowerName}."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3286818350" "-To Hit, -DMG"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3570112387" "Your chance to hit and Damage potential are reduced by the darkness."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Howling Twilight 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3229109842" "Howling Twilight"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P205558678" "Ranged (AoE), Minor DMG(Negative), Target Slow, -Recharge, -Regen, Disorient, Ally Rez"
// Power Help Text :
"P852421223" "Activating this power channels the power of the Netherworld to weaken your foes, in an attempt to revive all nearby fallen allies. You must stand near your defeated allies to revive them, then select a foe. The selected foe and all nearby foes will be Slowed, Disoriented, have their Regeneration rate reduced and drained of some life. Revived allies will have full Hit Points and Endurance and will be protected from XP Debt for 90 seconds. Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2058899669" "Your {PowerName} reduced {PlayerDest} attack rate and movement speed."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2669148710" "-Recharge, -SPD, Disorient"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P181463503" "You have been Disoriented.  Your Attack rate and Running speed are reduced by the Howling Twilight."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P713892034" "You disorient {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3202947871" "{PlayerSource} disorients you with their {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Shadow Fall 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2272064692" "Shadow Fall"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4241292887" "Toggle: PBAoE, Team Stealth, +DEF(All), +Res(Energy, Negative, Psionics, Fear)"
// Power Help Text :
"P890111217" "Envelops you and your nearby teammates in a shroud of darkness. Shadow Fall does not grant Invisibility, but it does make you harder to detect. Even if you are discovered, Shadow Fall grants a bonus to Defense bonus to all attacks and Resistance to Fear, while reducing Energy, Negative Energy, and Psionic Damage. You cannot use any other Concealment type power while using Shadow Fall. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1701765549" "You hide {PlayerDest} within your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1493333783" "You are hidden within the Shadow Fall."
// DisplayPowerDefenseFloat :
"P3802943013" "Avoided"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2430370769" "Stealth, +DEF(All), +Res(Energy, Negative, Psionics, Fear))"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2614214872" "Shadow Fall has made you difficult to detect, which increases your Defense.  Shadowfall also partially absorbs and deflects Energy, Negative Energy and Psionic damage. You are also less fearful."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fearsome Stare 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2548525324" "Fearsome Stare"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3376381813" "Ranged (Cone), Foe Fear, -To Hit"
// Power Help Text :
"P1658062660" "Instills tremendous Fear within a cone area in front of you, causing all affected targets to tremble in Terror uncontrollably, attacking only when attacked and even then with a reduced chance to hit.  Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1128528124" "Fear, -To Hit"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P335404104" "The Fearsome Stare has terrified you and reduced your chance to hit."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4251575090" "You terrorize {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3373413716" "{PlayerSource} has terrorized you with their {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Petrifying Gaze 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P799801114" "Petrifying Gaze"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P778647036" "Ranged Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P2575616074" "Petrifies a single targeted foe with a terrifying gaze. The victim is Held and defenseless. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2901818041" "Your {Powername} Holds {PlayerDest}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
