// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1145282425" "Capture"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3938244390" "You have been captured in a Detention Field.  You cannot be harmed, however, you can only use powers which affect yourself."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Personal Force Field 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3978803010" "Personal Force Field"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3032934705" "Toggle: Self +Def, Res(All except Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1475204497" "The Personal Force Field is almost impenetrable to all attacks, even Psionics and Enemy Teleportation, although attacks from more powerful foes may get through more easily. Personal Force Field will also reduce the damage of almost any attacks that do get through.  The Personal Force Field works both ways; while it is active, you can only use powers that affect yourself. Cannot be used with Rest. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3782792257" "Your {PowerName} makes you virtually invulnerable to most attacks, but you can only cast powers on yourself while the Force Field is active."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
