// Power Help Text :
"P301855645" "By channeling the energies present in nature you are able to immediately heal yourself and allies in front of you for a small amount of health and cause them to recover a small amount of health over time. Regrowth places a stack of Bloom on its target.  NOTE: When used in a PvP zone Regrowth will apply a moderate regeneration effect instead of a heal over time.  Recharge: Moderate"
