// Power Set : Pain Domination 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3134386314" "Pain Domination"
// DisplayHelp :
"P398776508" "Pain Domination gives a character the ability to manipulate, nullify and amplify pain.  Ultimately this grants the user powerful healing, buffing and debuffing powers.  It's healing output is unmatched!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Nullify Pain 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P175982904" "Nullify Pain"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1906443399" "PBAoE, Team +Heal"
// Power Help Text :
"P2671953981" "Nullify Pain will heal nearby allies for some hit points by numbing the pain caused by their wounds. Nullify Pain is not as potent as Soothe, but can heal multiple targets at once. Recharge: Moderate"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3262186852" "You nullify some of {PlayerDest}'s pain and heal them for {Damage} points of health."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1319995399" "{PlayerSource} nullifies some of your pain to heal you for {Damage} points of health."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Soothe 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2163960007" "Soothe"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P553708814" "Ally Heal"
// Power Help Text :
"P3872587599" "You heal an ally by numbing their pain and calming their mind. You cannot use this power on yourself."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P222304424" "You heal {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3640235457" "{PlayerSource} heals you for {Damage} points."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Share Pain 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P879858767" "Share Pain"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P744337357" "Ally Strong Heal, Self Moderate DMG(Special), +DMG"
// Power Help Text :
"P2245539053" "Share Pain draws away some of an ally's anguish caused by their wounds, but damages the user. The pain caused by this power causes the user to go into a frenzy, briefly increasing their damage output, however the user cannot be healed and will have their regeneration rate greatly diminished for a short time."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1263567590" "+DMG, -Heal"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2103335943" "Your damage has been boosted by tapping into an ally's anguish.  Additionally you cannot be healed or recover hit points for a short time."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P264829216" "You Absorb {Damage} points of damage and you are unable to heal for a brief while."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Conduit of Pain 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P22824042" "Conduit of Pain"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4216062541" "Ally Rez, Self +DMG, +Recharge, +Recovery, +To Hit, +Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P1449306112" "You revive a fallen ally by becoming a Conduit of Pain and transferring the pain that was inflicted upon them back upon your enemies.  This will briefly empower you increasing your damage output, recovery rate, attack rate and chance to hit.  After a minute the effect will wear off leaving you weakened for 30 seconds.  Your damage, attack rate and chance to hit will all be reduced during this period.  Recharge: Very Long."
// DisplayConfirm :
"P2466737886" "{PlayerSource} would like to Resurrect you.  You will have full Health and Endurance. Do you Accept?"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P467787459" "+DMG, +Recharge, +Recovery, +To Hit, +Specia"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1271921424" "The target of this power has been resurrected and they will have XP Debt Protection for 90 seconds.  The caster of this power will have their damage, chance to hit, recovery rate and recharge substantially boosted for a short time."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2115620002" "You Restore Consciousness to {PlayerDest} and heal them for {Damage} points of health."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1120711945" "{PlayerSource} returns you from the brink of death and heals you for {Damage} points of health."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3810057365" "The effects of {PowerName} wear off, weakening you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Enforced Morale 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1482189927" "Enforced Morale"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2378465487" "Ally +Res(Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize, Fear, Confuse), +Perception, +Recharge, +Speed, Minor DMG"
// Power Help Text :
"P1081314404" "Enforced Morale frees an ally from any Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Fear, Confuse and Immobilize effects and leaves them resistant to such effects for a good while. Also, Enforced Morale grants the target clearer Perception to see hidden foes, and a minor recharge and movement speed boost. The Protection and Movement boosts will improve with multiple applications and as you advance in level, although the Recharge and Movement boosts will only apply for the first few applications. If the ally is not damaged, Enforced Morale will cause them some pain before granting its benefits. Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1987621853" "You protect {PlayerDest} from Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Fear, Confuse and Immobilize effects with your {PowerName} power."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2884066914" "{PlayerSource} protects you from Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Fear, Confuse and Immobilize effects."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1046625860" "+Res(Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize, Fear, Confuse), +Perception, +Recharge, +Movement"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3640605281" "Your mind has been cleared of negative effects, and you are granted temporary resistance to Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Fear, Confuse and Immobilize effects and your Perception is improved."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Soothing Aura 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1144181223" "Suppress Pain"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P689862938" "Toggle: PBAoE, Ally +Regeneration"
// Power Help Text :
"P2059095436" "While this power is active all nearby allies will have their regeneration rate increased dramatically.  Recharge: Fast."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3760616659" "You activate your {PowerName} increasing the regeneration rate of  yourself and any nearby allies."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1343483540" "{PlayerSource} activates their {PowerName} boosting your regeneration rate."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3481954157" "+Periodic Heal"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1800862508" "You are standing within a Soothing Aura, you will periodically recovery health."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : World of Pain 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1251538091" "World of Pain"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1014532193" "PBAoE Team +To Hit, +DMG, +RES(All DMG, Placate)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2903785182" "When this power is activated the user and all nearby team members will gain a moderate damage, resistance, and To Hit bonus. Additionally those affected by this power will also be protected from Placate effects."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1535041317" "Your {PowerName} increases your team's chance to hit, damage resistance, Placate protection and damage output."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2486205930" "{PlayerSource} increases your team's chance to hit, damage resistance, Placate protection and damage output with their {PowerName}!"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P594937242" "+To Hit, +DMG, +RES(All DMG, Placate)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2601060428" "Your chance to hit, damage resistance, damage output is increased.  Additionally your resistance to Placate is increased."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Anguishing Cry 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P747186998" "Anguishing Cry"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2417726038" "PBAoE, Foe -RES(All), -DEF(All)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2543905602" "You let out an Anguishing Cry causing a great deal of pain in your foes reducing their resistance and defense to damage for a short time."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3615526159" "You let out an {PowerName} reducing the defense and resistance of {PlayerDest}!"
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2170765780" "The harsh sound of {PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} rings in your ears reducing your resistance and defense!"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2811264289" "-DEF, -RES(All)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3000401342" "Your resistance and defense has been reduced by the Anguishing Cry."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Painbringer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3871125677" "Painbringer"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1103158224" "Ally, +Regeneration, +Recovery, +DMG"
// Power Help Text :
"P3209306633" "You transform an ally to pain incarnate turning them into an inexhaustible killing machine. While the character is imbued with this power they will benefit from incredible health regeneration, endurance recovery and improved damage potential for a short time."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1450561046" "You empower {PlayerDest} with dramatically increased Endurance Recovery, Hit Point Regeneration and damage output."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2474556352" "{PlayerSource} empowers you with dramatically increased Endurance Recovery, Hit Point Regeneration and damage output."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2447182674" "+Regeneration, +Recovery, +DMG"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1854576963" "You have been inspired to inflict a great deal of pain.  Your regeneration, recovery and damage have been greatly increased!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Poison 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P4275575935" "Poison"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2841584505" "You are a master of Poison and can concoct a variety of venoms and toxins allowing you to weaken your enemies.  When used correctly, some Poisons can even be used to aid your allies."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Alkaloid 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3338218470" "Alkaloid"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P192217088" "Ally Heal, +Res(Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P633752156" "When used correctly, poisons can be used to heal, as well as harm.  Alkaloid consists of just the right amount of amino acids to safely heal a single targeted ally. The healed target is also left with some resistance to Toxic Damage (This Toxic Damage Resistance cannot be Enhanced). You cannot use this power to heal yourself. Recharge: Fast"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1198011080" "You heal {PlayerDest} {Damage} points of damage and improve their resistance to Toxic Damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P711986937" "{PlayerSource} heals you for {Damage} points of damage and improves you resistance to Toxic Damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Envenom 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1357149555" "Envenom"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2033004693" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -RES, -DEF, -Regen, -Heal"
// Power Help Text :
"P4054932572" "You Envenom your foe with a nasty poison, the poison then spreads to nearby foes.  The toxin directly attacks the immune system, reducing the affected target's Defense, Damage Resistance and Hit Point Regeneration Rate.  The poison is so potent, that the target actually responds less to Healing while affected by the poison.   Secondary foes struck by this power will have a lesser effect placed on them while the primary target receives the full effectiveness of the power.  Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2132842561" "You Envenom {PlayerDest} and reduced their Defense and Damage Resistance and Regeneration."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P4263359596" "{PlayerSource} reduces your Defense, Damage Resistance and Regeneration with their {PowerName}!"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1511201118" "-RES, -DEF, -Regen, -Heal"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3705153969" "Your Defense, Damage Resistances and Regeneration have been reduced.  You also Heal less from Heal powers."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Weaken 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2214790859" "Weaken"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3098322516" "Ranged (Targeted AoE) Foe -DMG -To Hit, -Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P4153236241" "You poison a single foe with a venom that significantly Weakens their strength and and that of nearby foes.   The affected primary target's chance to hit and Damage output is severely reduced Additionally, the affected targets secondary power effects are all weakened. The targets power effects like Heals, Defense Buffs, Endurance Drains, Disorients, Holds, Immobilizes, Knockbacks and more, are all weakened.  Secondary foes struck by this power will have a lesser effect placed on them while the primary target receives the full effectiveness of the power.  Recharge: Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P4213374470" "You Weaken {PlayerDest} and reduce their chance to hit, damage and power effects."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1094182561" "{PlayerSource} reduces your chance to hit, Damage and power effects with their {PowerName}!"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1749202183" "-To Hit, -DMG, -Special"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P870938078" "Your chance to hit and Damage potential and power effects have all been reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Neurotoxic Breath 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1837006782" "Neurotoxic Breath"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3242282090" "Ranged (Cone), Foe -SPD, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P413475405" "You can breath a cone of Neurotoxin gas that quickly start to anesthetize any nearby foes.  Affected targets may choke on the gas as their movement and attack rate are severely reduced. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P706922686" "Your {PowerName} dramatically Slows the attack speed and movement of {PlayerDest}"
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3646837205" "{PlayerSource} Slows you with their {PowerName}."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1490875287" "-SPD, -Recharge"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3697806060" "You are choking on Neurotoxic gas.  Your attack rate and movement speed are reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Elixir of Life 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2164945405" "Elixir of Life"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2944072660" "Close, Ally Rez, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P2036775056" "With this Elixir, you can revive a fallen ally and turn him into a killing machine. The revived target has increased damage, chance to hit, Endurance recovery, and attack speed, and gains a resistance to Toxic damage. A brew of this sort is not without its side effects. The revived target will soon become very sick and severely weak after about 90 seconds. All effects of the Elixir will eventually wear off. Elixir of Life can only be used on Players and cannot be used on your Henchmen.  Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayConfirm :
"P2987816183" "{PlayerSource} would like to Resurrect you.  You will have full Health and Endurance and be extremely powerful for a while, but will weaken after 90 seconds. Do you Accept?"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2211841663" "Special"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4150946459" "Your have been saved by the Elixir of Life.  Your chance to hit and attack rate are improved. Your damage and Endurance recovery are increased as well and you gain a resistance to Toxic damage.  You are also protected from XP Debt for 90 seconds. The experience is taxing however, and you will soon weaken when all of the effects of the Elixir wear off."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2180373901" "You give {PlayerDest} your Elixir of Life and revive them returning {Damage} points of health."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1078120874" "{PlayerSource} returns you from the brink of death and heals you for {Damage} points of damage with an Elixir of Life. For a while, the Elixir has increased strength, but it will wears off fast, and you will be become sick and weak in about 90 seconds."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3379169905" "Your Elixir has worn off, and you are now sick and weakened."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Antidote 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3729372453" "Antidote"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1579801539" "Ally +Res(Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize, Confuse, Fear, Slow, Cold, Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1204937636" "This Antidote can free an ally from any Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Slow, Confuse, Fear and Immobilize effects and leaves them resistant to such effects for a good while. The Antidote also grants the target some resistance to Cold and Toxic damage. Some of the effects of this power will improve with Multiple applications and as you advance in level. Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P4104594625" "You protect {PlayerDest} from Slow, Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Confuse, Fear and Immobilize effects as well as Toxic and Cold Damage with your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1108383803" "{PlayerSource} protects you from Slow, Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Confuse, Fear and Immobilize effects and improves your resistance to Toxic and Cold Damage."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P456139789" "+Res(Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize, Confuse, Fear, Slow, Cold, Toxic)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P69254025" "The Antidote has granted you temporary resistance to Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Confuse and Fear and Immobilize effects and your resistance to Toxic and Cold Damage is improved."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Paralytic Poison 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2127894003" "Paralytic Poison"
// Power Help Text :
"P4045211070" "This Paralytic Poison viciously attacks a foe's nervous system and can leave an affected target completely Held and defenseless. Recharge: Slow"
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3786662314" "{PlayerSource} attempts to Hold you with a Paralytic Poison."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3285550051" "The Paralytic Poison has left you completely Held and defenseless!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Poison Trap 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1358094474" "Poison Trap"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P673564903" "Place Trap: PBAoE Foe Hold, -END, -Recovery, Chance to Hold, Minor DoT(Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1057178172" "You can build a Poison Trap on the ground. Any foes that pass near the Poison Trap will cause it to detonate and release its toxic vapors. The poison is a highly toxic nerve gas, and any foes in the affected area may be drained of much of their Endurance and quickly Held or begin choking while suffering a minor amount of Toxic damage over time.  The trap is almost impossible to detect, but it is fragile and may be set off by an enemy's explosion. Even if destroyed, the Trap will detonate. Recharge: Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Noxious Gas 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3018093279" "Noxious Gas"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P565430152" "Ranged (Infect Henchman); Foe -RES, -DEF, -To Hit, -Res, +Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P976520563" "You can infect one of your Henchmen, surrounding him with a Noxious Gas.  All foes near the infected Henchmen will be overcome with the Noxious Gas.  Their Defense, chance to hit, Damage and Damage resistance will all be reduced.  Additionally, there is a chance than any affected humanoid enemy will become violently ill.  Even the mightiest foe will stop dead in their tracks, and left helpless as they empty the contents of their stomach. Recharge: Very Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3337240024" "You infect {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} weakening nearby enemies!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Sonic Resonance 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P565143336" "Sonic Resonance"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2998248482" "You have the ability to control sound in several fashions.  You can create semi-solid barriers, set up waves which weaken or strengthen a target, as well as creating soothing sounds which act to counteract any negative effects which may exist on your friends."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sonic Siphon 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P646438851" "Sonic Siphon"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3255195607" "Ranged, Foe -Res(All)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1007995414" "By setting up a constant vibration within the body of your foe, you weaken their Damage Resistance. Affected targets will take more damage from successful attacks.   Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3647738614" "Your {PowerName} has reduced {PlayerDest}'s resistances."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P290923559" "Your Resistances have been weakened by the Sonic attack."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3466742994" "-Res(All)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sonic Barrier 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3785736125" "Sonic Barrier"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2639635747" "Ranged, Ally +Res(Smash, Lethal, Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P369890919" "This shield dramatically reduces the damage an ally takes from Smashing, Lethal, and Toxic attacks for a limited time. You cannot stack multiple Sonic Barriers on the same target, however the shield can be improved by another ally using the same power. Can also be used in conjunction with your Sonic Haven. You cannot use this power on yourself. Recharge: Very Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2959881722" "You protect {PlayerDest} from physical attacks with your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3976820757" "{PlayerSource} protects you from physical attacks with a {PowerName}."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3556417710" "+Res(Smash, Lethal, Toxic)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P961837590" "The Sonic Barrier has increased your resistances to Smashing, Lethal and Toxic damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sonic Haven 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1160094573" "Sonic Haven"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3358878122" "Ranged, Ally +Res(Fire, Cold, Energy, Negative Energy)"
// Power Help Text :
"P4009395013" "This shield dramatically reduces the damage an ally takes from Fire, Cold, Energy, and Negative Energy attacks for a limited time. You cannot stack multiple Sonic Havens on the same target, however the shield can be improved by another ally using the same power. Can also be used in conjunction with your Sonic Barrier. You cannot use this power on yourself.  Recharge: Very Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1134754149" "You protect {PlayerDest} from fire, cold, energy and negative energy attacks with your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P391050924" "{PlayerSource} protects you from fire, cold, energy and negative energy attacks with a {PowerName}."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P321411657" "+Res(Fire, Cold, Energy, Negative Energy)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P246186843" "The Sonic Haven has increased your resistances to Fire, Cold, Energy and Negative Energy damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sonic Cage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1900924020" "Sonic Cage"
// Power Help Text :
"P3763336210" "Encases the target in an impenetrable field of sonic waves. The target cannot attack or be attacked.  Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3432540632" "You have been enveloped in a Sonic Cage. You cannot be harmed, but you can only use powers which affect you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Disruption Field 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2857326375" "Disruption Field"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2877695354" "Toggle: Ranged (Target Ally AoE), Foe -Res"
// Power Help Text :
"P2163685874" "You set up a constant wave of sonic energy around an ally, weakening the Damage Resistance of all nearby foes. Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1783404976" "The Disruption Field creates an area around a target ally which reduces the Resistance of all foes near them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sonic Dispersion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P134395228" "Sonic Dispersion"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2105574571" "Toggle: PBAoE, Ally +Res(All DMG except Psionic, Hold, Immobilize, Disorient)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3945274325" "You create a large field of sonic waves, protecting all allies inside. The Sonic Dispersion gives all allies within increased Resistance against all damage except Psionic. The Sonic Bubble also protects allies from Immobilization, Disorient, and Hold effects. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3939492490" "You protect {PlayerDest} from most damage types with your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2535806516" "{PlayerSource} protects you from most damage types with a {PowerName}."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2481919485" "+Res(All Damage but Psionic, Hold, Immobilize, Disorient)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2778820193" "The Sonic Dispersion field is granting you Resistance to all types of damage, except psionic, as well as Hold, Immobilize and Disorienting effects."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sonic Repulsion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P217190461" "Sonic Repulsion"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2989681105" "Toggle: Ranged (Target Ally AoE), Foe Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P1783834580" "You create a powerful sonic resonance around an ally, repelling all foes nearby. You will lose endurance for each target repelled.  Recharge: Moderate"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2100668018" "Your {PowerName} reduced the damage potential of all nearby foes."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3932749949" "A sonic resonance envelops you, repelling all foes who attempt to get near you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Clarity 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3612462228" "Clarity"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P607744490" "Ally +Res(Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize, Fear, Confusion), +Perception"
// Power Help Text :
"P2786856494" "By bouncing a carefully pitched sound wave off an ally's ear drum, you can free him from any Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Confusion, Fear, and Immobilize effects, and leave them resistant to such effects for a good while. Protection will improve with multiple applications and as you advance in level. Clarity also provides your ally's enhanced perception. Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3942129800" "You protect {PlayerDest} from Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Confuse, Fear and Immobilize effects and improve his Perception."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2019260028" "{PlayerSource} protects you from Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Fear, Confuse and Immobilize effects and improves your perception."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1474485343" "+Res(Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize, Fear, Confuse), +Perception"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2940769611" "The soothing waves of sound clear your mind of all Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Fear, Confuse and Immobilize effects and improves your perception."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Liquefy 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4245490498" "Liquefy"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3667730175" "Ranged (Location AoE), Foe Knockback, Hold, -To Hit, -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P2657036857" "You unleash a barrage of sonic waves on the Earth itself, generating a powerful, localized earthquake. Most foes that pass through the location will fall down. The violent shaking also reduces their chance to hit and Defense. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3038096106" "DoT(Smashing), -To Hit, -DEF"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1669471132" "The ground beneath you has been liquefied!  You are stuck in sludge and taking minor damage.  Your chance to hit Defense and movement rates are reduced."

