// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Time Manipulation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P869452725" "Time Manipulation"
// DisplayHelp :
"P53484883" "By gazing into the flow of time you are able to manipulate time itself.  Time Manipulation allows the wielder to inflict crippling debuffs, buff and heal allies and also be able to empower effects on single targets through careful use of Time Crawl and Temporal Selection."
// SetAccountTooltip :
"P523734060" "You need to either be a VIP player or have purchased the Time Manipulation power set to have access to this feature."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Time Crawl 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2238940030" "Time Crawl"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1722587764" "Ranged Foe, -Speed, -Recharge, -Regen, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P3536371248" "You're able to dramatically slow the time around a single enemy, reducing their movement speed and attack rate.  Time is slowed to such an extreme that their wounds will take longer to heal, reducing their regeneration rate.  Time Crawl applies the Delayed effect on its target.  Debuff and control effects from other Time Manipulation powers are increased on targets affected by Delayed.  Recharge: Long."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P80878853" "-Speed, -Recharge, -Regen, Special"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3482489949" "Your attack rate, movement speed and regeneration rate have been reduced"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4250415469" "You reduce the attack rate, movement speed, regeneration rate of the target."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2451870868" "{PlayerSource} slows you down to a crawl with their {PowerName}, reducing your movement speed, attack speed and regeneration speed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Temporal Mending 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P20492702" "Temporal Mending"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2562578656" "PBAoE, Ally +Heal, Heal Over Time, +Res(Slow, Regen Debuff)"
// Power Help Text :
"P637007078" "You mend the wounds of yourself and nearby allies by placing your bodies in a past or future state where they are far less injured.  Temporal Mending will immediately heal its targets and continue to heal them for an equal amount over the next 6 seconds.  Additionally, affected allies will gain some resistance to slow effects and regeneration debuffs.  Allies affected by the Accelerated effect will receive additional healing from this power.  Temporal Mending will apply a regeneration bonus instead of heal over time for a short while if the user is in a PvP zone.  Recharge: Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1964158182" "Your {PowerName} heals you for {Damage} health."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2599404221" "{PlayerSource} heals you for {Damage} health with their {PowerName}."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1831842746" "Your {PowerName} continues to heal you for {Damage} health."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4029204276" "{PlayerSource} continually heals you for {Damage} health with their {PowerName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Times Juncture 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1147937862" "Time's Juncture"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2191782139" "Toggle: PBAoE Foe (-Damage, -Speed, -To Hit)"
// Power Help Text :
"P4222109235" "You create a time dilation field around you causing enemies who get too close to be slowed to a crawl, their movement speed, damage and chance to hit will be decreased substantially.  Enemies affected by Delayed have these affects increased.  Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3595822575" "You reduce the damage, movement speed and chance to hit of all nearby foes with your {PowerName}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2549879092" "{PlayerSource} reduces your damage, speed and chance to hit with their {PowerName}!"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1722386105" "-Damage, -Speed, -To Hit"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P384004502" "The flow of time has been dramatically slowed around the foe using Time's Juncture reducing your damage, speed and chance to hit."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Temporal Selection 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P492426561" "Temporal Selection"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3301978780" "Ally +Damage, +Recharge, +Regeneration"
// Power Help Text :
"P3815890288" "You distort time around an ally, selecting a period of time where their abilities are at their highest.  Their damage, attack rate and regeneration rates are dramatically increased for a brief period.  This power places the Accelerated effect on the target.  While this is in effect, the target has any healing and healing over time effects from Temporal Mending or Chrono Shift significantly increased.  Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P170218134" "You significantly increase {PlayerDest}'s damage, recharge rate and regeneration for a short time."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1338077671" "{PlayerSource} greatly increases your Damage, Recharge Rate and Regeneration."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P760049584" "+Damage, +Recharge, +Regeneration"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2257768674" "Your movements have been sped up as if you're flowing more quickly through time.  You gain a significant bonus to your damage, recharge rate and regeneration."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Distortion Field 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3035182246" "Distortion Field"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2771735844" "Ranged (Location AoE), Foe(-Recharge, -Speed), Chance for Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P2049484381" "You can choose an area to slow the flow of time down to a crawl. Enemies who enter the field will have their attack rate and speed slowed dramatically. In addition, affected enemies might become held as they are frozen in time. Targets affected by Time Crawl will have the chance to be held increased. Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3340992146" "Your {PowerName} reduces your targets' Movement and Recharge Speed."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3095982155" "-Speed, -Recharge"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2656174618" "The Distortion Field has reduced your Recharge and Movement Speed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Time Stop 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1303004440" "Time Stop"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4217442808" "Ranged Hold, Foe -Regen, -Heal"
// Power Help Text :
"P3620751643" "You trap your target within the flow of time causing them to be held helpless.  Even those resistant to the effects of Time Stop's hold will still have their regeneration rate and healing effects reduced for a brief period.  Targets affected by Time Crawl will suffer from a more powerful hold, however its benefits are brief.  Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2288338409" "Hold, -Heal, -Regen"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3345956946" "You have been held by Time Stop.  Your healing effects and regeneration rate have also been reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3996881439" "You hold {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} and reduce their healing and regeneration rate!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P258318004" "{PlayerSource} holds you with their {PowerName} and reduces your regeneration rate and healing!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1338756627" "Your Time Crawl effect empowers {PowerName}'s hold effect on {PlayerDest}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3804716665" "Being Delayed has caused {PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} to be more effective."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Farsight 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2926793761" "Farsight"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3803720508" "PBAoE Team, +To-Hit, +Defense(All), +Perception"
// Power Help Text :
"P2293728109" "You give your allies a brief glimpse of the future and what is to come.  This provides you and your team a moderate increase to your chance to hit and defense for a short period of time.   Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3619822295" "You grant your allies the ability to briefly glimpse into the future thus increasing their Defense, Perception and Chance to Hit."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1389102462" "{PlayerSource} boosts your Defense, Perception and Chance to Hit with {PowerName}."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P4278084149" "+To-Hit, +Defense(All), +Perception"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2593400803" "You have brief glimpses of the future allowing you to predict your foes' movements.  Your Defense, Perception and Chance to Hit is increased briefly."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Slowed Response 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1310678703" "Slowed Response"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3824425035" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -Defense, -Resistance"
// Power Help Text :
"P4177343132" "You manipulate time around a targeted foe causing their reflexes to become slowed and sluggish.  This causes them to have decreased defense and damage resistance.  A target affected by Time Crawl will suffer from a more powerful effect.  Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1600483695" "Your {PowerName} reduces the defenses and resistances of your target and nearby foes."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P2407039961" "{PlayerSource} reduces your defense and resistances with their {PowerName}"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3877240234" "-Defense(All), -Resistance(All)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2935672040" "Your defense and resistance has been lowered by Slowed Response."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Chrono Shift 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3129124653" "Chrono Shift"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3641143153" "PBAoE, Team +Recharge, Moderate Healing over Time"
// Power Help Text :
"P1075501167" "You cause nearby allies to act more quickly by allowing them to slip through the time stream seamlessly.  Chrono Shift will greatly increase the Recharge Speed of nearby allies for the duration of the power, additionally for a short while the flow of time will constantly undo a portion of your allies' wounds causing them to periodically recover health.  An ally affected by Temporal Selection will recover additional health from Chrono Shift.  Chrono Shift will apply a regeneration bonus instead of heal over time for a short while if the user is in a PvP zone.  Recharge: Very Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P689989828" "Your {PowerName} heal you for {Damage} health."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P147486625" "Your {PowerName} restores {Damage} endurance."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P168839769" "{PlayerSource} restores {Damage} endurance with their {PowerName}."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Traps 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1705053798" "Traps"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2389012708" "Traps are devices and gadgets you construct to cripple your foes. By using them strategically, you can gain a great tactical advantage. Traps include ambush devises, as well as gadgets that can be constructed to aid you and your allies."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Web Grenade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3189667928" "Web Grenade"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1642214998" "Ranged, Target Immobilize, -Recharge, -Fly"
// Power Help Text :
"P153366950" "Upon impact, the Web Grenade expels a strong, tenuous, and very sticky substance that can Immobilize most targets. This non-lethal device deals no damage and does not prevent targets from attacking, although their attack rate is Slowed. The Web can bring down flying entities and halts jumping. Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3505771407" "Immobilize, -Fly, -Recharge"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1730420478" "You have been caught in a web.  You cannot move or fly and your attack speed is reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Caltrops 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4162546018" "Caltrops"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3697396555" "Ranged (Location AoE), Minor DoT(Lethal), Foe -Speed"
// Power Help Text :
"P1025458138" "You toss a handful of Caltrops at a targeted location and spread the tiny metal spikes over a large area. Any enemy that pass over the Caltrops will be forced to move at a slower rate. They will also take some trivial Lethal damage over time. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1637966331" "DoT(Lethal), -SPD"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1306558302" "The caltrops are causing minor damage to you and slowing your running speed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Triage Beacon 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3860346273" "Triage Beacon"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3379444764" "Place Beacon: PBAoE +Regen"
// Power Help Text :
"P2896528946" "You can plant a Triage Beacon into the ground. The Beacon is immobile, but it emits a powerful healing aura. The Regeneration Rate of you, or your allies, will be greatly increased as long as you are near the Triage Beacon.  The Beacon is invulnerable. Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Acid Mortar 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3586814929" "Acid Mortar"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1629705238" "Place Trap: Ranged (AoE), Minor DoT(Toxic), Foe -Res(All), -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P3788080768" "You can place a small Mortar on the ground. If an enemy passes nearby, the Mortar will fire an Acid grenade at the target.  The grenade will explodes in a small shower of acid on impact. This acid eats through armor, causing minor damage over time. It reduces the target's Defense as well as their Damage Resistance.  The mortar will last up to 60 seconds and will fire up to 10 grenades. It can be destroyed by your foes. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Slow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Force Field Generator 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1946739647" "Force Field Generator"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1025502389" "Place Drone: PBAoE, Team +DEF, +Res(Hold, Immobilize, Disorient)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1221351809" "You can build a Force Field Generator Drone.  It will generate a Dispersion Bubble that gives all nearby allies increased Defense against all attacks including Psionic. The Dispersion Bubble also protects allies from Immobilization, Disorient, and Hold effects. The Drone will follow you, can be buffed and healed or even destroyed.  However, it is not a Henchman and cannot be given commands. Limited to one Force Field Generator.  Recharge: Very Slow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Poison Trap 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2416056650" "Place Trap: PBAoE Foe Choke, Vomit, -Regen, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P3754884774" "You can build a Poison Gas Trap on the ground. Any foes that pass near the Poison Trap will cause it to detonate and release its toxic vapors. The poison is a very noxious gas, and any foes in the affected area may start to choke or even vomit.  Affected Foes Regeneration rate and attack rate will be reduced as well. The trap is almost impossible to detect, but it is fragile and may be set off by an enemy's explosion. Even if destroyed, the Trap will detonate. Recharge: Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Seeker Drones 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3542936972" "Seeker Drones"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P44989205" "Summon Seekers: Ranged Disorient, -DMG, -To Hit, -Perception, Low DMG(Energy)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2851713771" "You create two Seeker Drones. These Seeker Drones will follow you until they detect an enemy and then they will zero in on their targets and detonate on impact. The small explosive flash of energy does only minor damage, but the concussion can weaken foes.  Affected targets will have reduced Damage, chance to hit and Perception and may even be Disoriented for a short while.  You can only ever have Two Seeker Drones out at one time and they can be destroyed by your foes. Recharge: Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Trip Mine 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P466688635" "Trip Mine"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2631147992" "Place Mine: PBAoE, Superior DMG(Lethal/Fire), Foe Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P652232395" "You can place a Trip Mine on the ground. Any foes that pass near the Trip Mine will cause it to explode, severely damaging all nearby foes and sending them flying. The Trip Mine is almost impossible to detect, but it is fragile and may be set off by an enemy's explosion. Even if destroyed, the Trip Mine will detonate. Setting a mine is delicate work, and if you are interrupted, you will fail. Damage: Superior, Recharge: Slow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Detonator 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3069665139" "Detonator"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P293194417" "Sacrifice Henchman, PBAoE, Extreme DMG(Lethal/Fire), Foe Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P1509250777" "A good Mastermind  always plans ahead, but a great one knows when to make a strategic sacrifice.  You have equipped all your Henchmen with explosives.  When the time is right, select a Henchman and set off the Detonator. Undead and Robots are easily rigged and will blow up instantly, devastating nearby enemies.  Ninjas, Soldiers and other free thinking Henchmen will try to place the explosive on the ground and get away.  But you know... the fuse is short.  Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1821941840" "You protect {PlayerDest} from Slow, Disorient, Hold, Sleep, and Immobilize effects and Toxic Damage with your {PowerName} power."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P987519504" "{PlayerSource} protects you from Slow, Disorient, Hold, Sleep, and Immobilize effects and improves your resistance to Toxic Damage."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3366835073" "+Res(Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize, Slow, Toxic)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4196796945" "The Antidote has granted you temporary resistance to Disorient, Hold, Sleep, and Immobilize effects and your resistance to Toxic Damage is improved."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Trick Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2922508614" "Trick Arrow"
// DisplayHelp :
"P4162466956" "Trick Arrows are tipped with an odd variety of payloads, which if used strategically, can dramatically alter a battle site."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Entangling Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3890749173" "Entangling Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2638259388" "Ranged, Target Immobilize, -Fly, Slow"
// Power Help Text :
"P4026626189" "Upon impact, the Entangling Arrow releases a strong net that can Immobilize most targets. This non-lethal device deals no damage and does not prevent targets from attacking. The Entangling Arrow can bring down flying entities, halts jumping and slows all of your actions. Entangling Arrow has a fairly low Endurance cost and a bonus to its Accuracy. Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2964557942" "Immobilize, -Fly, Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3914642772" "You have been caught in a net.  You cannot move or fly and your actions are slowed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Flash Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2538058937" "Flash Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2306152642" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -Visibility, -To Hit"
// Power Help Text :
"P1467846841" "This arrow explodes in a dazzling flash of light and sound. The targets are so blinded that they can hardly see a thing. Most foes will not be able to see past normal melee range, although some may have better perception. If the foes are attacked, they will be alerted to your presence, but will suffer a penalty to their chance to hit.  Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2203852352" "-Visibility, -To Hit"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2481906454" "The flash of light has left you dazzled.  Your chance to hit and range of sight are greatly diminished."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Glue Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3237857720" "Glue Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P766338561" "Ranged (Location AoE), Foe -Speed, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P623210925" "This arrow carries a cartridge of intensely sticky glue, which explodes on impact. The glue Slows the movement and attack rates of any foes in the area. Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4234428342" "You use a {PowerName} to create a sticky patch of ground!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Ice Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3416938233" "Ice Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3570542779" "Ranged, Foe Hold, -SPD, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P3906379218" "This arrow can freeze a single foe in a block of ice. The target is frozen solid, helpless, and can be attacked. More powerful foes may not be Held, but all affected targets will be Slowed. Recharge: Moderate"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2323736588" "Your {PowerName} freezes {PlayerDest} in place holding them!"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2267104667" "Hold, -SPD, -Recharge"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1196691141" "You are frozen in a Block of Ice.  Once free, your Attack Rate and Running speed will be reduced slightly for a while."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Poison Gas Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2744262583" "Poison Gas Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P125124087" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -DMG, Sleep"
// Power Help Text :
"P3155999525" "This arrow carries a capsule cloud of poisonous gas, which explodes on impact and weakens all foes in its vicinity. Affected foes damage potential will be severely reduced. Some foes will react badly to the poison and choke for a time, though they will react if attacked.  Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1427562046" "You use a {PowerName} to release a noxious poison gas!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Acid Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2671335934" "Acid Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1594890146" "Ranged (AoE) Minor DoT(Toxic), Foe -Res(All), -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P328978290" "This arrow explodes in a small shower of acid on impact. This acid eats through armor, causing damage over time. It reduces the target's Defense as well as their Damage Resistance.  Damage: Minor, Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3256323102" "Your {PowerName} splashes acid on {PlayerDest}."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1078456055" "{PlayerSource} hits you with an Acid Arrow.  The acid is burning you and reducing your damage resistance and defense."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2396833550" "-Res(All), -DEF, Minor DoT(Toxic)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1207406105" "Your Resistances and Defense have been weakened by the Acid Arrow."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2695861904" "You take {Damage} points of Toxic Damage from the Acid Arrow."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Disruption Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P697171009" "Disruption Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1774769806" "Ranged (Location AoE), -Res(All)"
// Power Help Text :
"P548914281" "This arrow plants a sonic resonator at a target location. The vibrations of the resonator weaken the Damage Resistance of all nearby foes. Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1489999320" "The Disruption Arrow has lowered your Resistances."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3032945010" "Your {PowerName} reduces your targets resistances."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Oil Slick Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P851023681" "Oil Slick Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2794896108" "Ranged (Location AoE), Knockdown, -Speed, -DEF, +Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P3872456209" "On impact, this arrow creates an oil slick that Slows foes in the area and may cause them to slip and fall. The oil slick is very flammable and may burst into flames if fire is used near it.  Recharge: Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : EMP Arrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P993615740" "EMP Arrow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2866713678" "Ranged AoE, Foe Hold, Special vs. Robots, Self -Recovery"
// Power Help Text :
"P1270949106" "This arrow can unleash a massive pulse of electromagnetic energy on impact. This EMP can affect machines, and is even powerful enough to affect synaptic brain patterns. It will incapacitate all foes in its radius. Additionally, most machines and robots will take  high damage. However, this power uses a lot of Endurance and leaves you unable to recover Endurance for a while. Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P799513638" "Hold, -Regen"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3357512105" "You are held immobile by the EMP Pulse, and your Regeneration Rate is reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P979108465" "Your {PowerName} holds {PlayerDest}."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2753580196" "Your {PowerName} Disorients and Immobilizes {PlayerDest}."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1102804825" "Your {PowerName} drains {PlayerDest} of some Endurance."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P456748222" "{PlayerSource} shocks you with their {PowerName} and drains some of your Endurance!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1746676435" "Your {PowerName} blasts {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1371424338" "{PlayerSource} blasts you for {Damage} points of energy damage with their {PowerName}."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2665432657" "Your {PowerName} has left you exhausted!"
